{
  "name": "move_in",
  "description": "A whole history built on the server - accounts in two currencies, an edited record, an archived category, transfers (one across currencies, one deleted), two corrections with records created after them, settings, a weekly plan with a confirmed and a skipped occurrence, a monthly one, and one whose schedule changed after a skip and a confirmation, budgets and carry-over resets (one revoked), goals in every state with every kind of allocation, a committed statement and an open session - then the server's privacy export moved into an empty Local store (unit 10b, ADR-123), and every figure compared with the server's own answers: balances, records, budget summaries, carry-over, envelopes, free money, goal progress, occurrences, reminders and spend; then the same statement is a duplicate on both.",
